{"4456030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hauntrap", "steam_appid": 4456030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hauntrap</strong> is an asymmetric multiplayer horror game where one <strong>player-controlled monster</strong> hunts down a team of survivors trapped inside an experimental facility.<br>No predictable AI.<br>No scripted jumpscares.<br>Your enemy thinks, adapts… and chases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, repair the fuses, and escape through the main gate — but be warned:<br><strong>placing the final fuse triggers the Hunt Phase</strong>, turning the monster into a ruthless predator with increased speed and tracking power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 PLAY AS ONE OF SIX UNIQUE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has its own playstyle, strengths, and terrifying abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracker</strong> – Reveals survivor positions for a short period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute</strong> – High speed and massive damage, knocks down survivors instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shade</strong> – Turns invisible and ambushes unsuspecting players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong> – Disguises as any survivor and blends into the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disruptor</strong> – Darkens the level and disables survivor flashlights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toxic</strong> – Spreads dangerous gas that follows survivor paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ability has its own cooldown, making each chase unpredictable and deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧍 SURVIVE AS ONE OF EIGHT SPECIALIZED SURVIVORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors aren’t helpless. Choose from different roles and playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong> – Heal teammates faster, revive more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout</strong> – Detect key items and objectives from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> – Withstand hits and survive longer during the Hunt Phase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility Roles</strong> – Fix generators, place fuses, and navigate the map faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coordinated team can outsmart even the strongest monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hauntrap</strong> is an asymmetric multiplayer horror game where one <strong>player-controlled monster</strong> hunts down a team of survivors trapped inside an experimental facility.<br>No predictable AI.<br>No scripted jumpscares.<br>Your enemy thinks, adapts… and chases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, repair the fuses, and escape through the main gate — but be warned:<br><strong>placing the final fuse triggers the Hunt Phase</strong>, turning the monster into a ruthless predator with increased speed and tracking power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/d75f04f6ce5b7f7846e34e098c22e03e.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 PLAY AS ONE OF SIX UNIQUE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has its own playstyle, strengths, and terrifying abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracker</strong> – Reveals survivor positions for a short period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute</strong> – High speed and massive damage, knocks down survivors instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shade</strong> – Turns invisible and ambushes unsuspecting players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong> – Disguises as any survivor and blends into the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disruptor</strong> – Darkens the level and disables survivor flashlights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toxic</strong> – Spreads dangerous gas that follows survivor paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ability has its own cooldown, making each chase unpredictable and deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/926bd75bf7e750249489287d0e702415.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧍 SURVIVE AS ONE OF EIGHT SPECIALIZED SURVIVORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors aren’t helpless. Choose from different roles and playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong> – Heal teammates faster, revive more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout</strong> – Detect key items and objectives from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> – Withstand hits and survive longer during the Hunt Phase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility Roles</strong> – Fix generators, place fuses, and navigate the map faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coordinated team can outsmart even the strongest monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.poster.avif?t=1786709841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.webm?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/extras/5aa022e4e65145773561e9299d31e33c.mp4?t=1786709841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Asymmetric PvP horror where a player-controlled monster hunts survivors through dark experimental halls. Fix fuses. Trigger the Hunt. Escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Uzbek<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/05303f93574b1a9b34a47c1acc12a41761a69bce/header.jpg?t=1786709841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/a8ef6ebc802f55bd3213d18a4684d989b0de01d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786709841", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456030/a8ef6ebc802f55bd3213d18a4684d989b0de01d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786709841", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64